<translation id="3846683726093018685">**Fingqa:** Ngomusho owodwa onamagama angaphansi kwa-30, chaza abantu ebhekiswe kubo nenjongo eyinhloko yekhontenti yakho eku-screenshot.

          **Phakamisa Imibuzo:** Sungula uhlu lwamachashazi olunemibuzo emi-3 ukuya kwemi-5 eshukumisa ingqondo engase ibuzwe umsebenzisi ukuze asiqonde kahle i-screenshot. Le mibuzo kufanele ihlanganise okungenani owodwa okhuluma ngokuqondile ngento ebukwayo, indlela eklanywe ngayo, noma indawo ekuyo.</translation>
<translation id="8979989643967423454"><ph name="PAGE_TITLE"/> - FlyWeb</translation>
<translation id="2980328991301740921">Ukuze uthole amabhukhimakhi nokukumadivayisi akho, ngena ngemvume kuBrave</translation>
<translation id="3885770153807205175">Okokukhetha ulimi</translation>
<translation id="5175060854726708547">Yenza ngokwezifiso uphinde ulawule i-FlyWeb. Okuthile kudinga ukuthi ukunake - chofoza ngemininingwane.</translation>
