<translation id="3892148308691398805">Kopisha umbhalo</translation>
<translation id="5145107420478372433">U-<ph name="EXISTING_USER"/> usengene ngemvume kakade kule phrofayela ye-FlyWeb. Ukuze uqhubeke nokuphequlula ngokwehlukile, i-FlyWeb ingakwazi ukukudalela iphrofayela yakho.</translation>
<translation id="3470813199863172076">Lesi sandiso sephula inqubomgomo Yesitolo sewebu se-FlyWeb, futhi kungenzeka singabi esiphephile. Sisuse ku-FlyWeb ukuze singasakwazi ukubona nokushintsha idatha yakho kumasayithi owavakashelayo, okufaka phakathi ulwazi lwakho lomuntu siqu.</translation>
<translation id="3941890832296813527">Iphutha lokufaka: Igama lefayela lesifaki alivumelekile noma alisekelwe.</translation>
<translation id="8536259619256229278">I-FlyWeb izama ukukopisha amaphasiwedi. Thayipha iphasiwedi yakho ye-Windows ukuze uvumele lokhu.</translation>
<translation id="7965008434896274911">Ukuze uthole imininingwane oyigcinile nokukumadivayisi akho, ngena ngemvume kuBrave</translation>
<translation id="4540773594514226705">Amaphasiwedi akho, izindlela zokukhokha, namakheli owalondoloze kuBrave sync chain yakho azosuswa kule divayisi. Ukuze uphinde uzisebenzise kuBrave, ngena ngemvume futhi.</translation>
<translation id="395904275706073188">Amakhasi avikelwe awakwazi ukufundwa. Zama ikhasi elehlukile.</translation>
<translation id="3849784651193576458">Funda ukuthi i-FlyWeb ikugcina kanjani uphephile</translation>
<translation id="3967822245660637423">Ukulanda kuqedile</translation>
<translation id="562495843857641474">Uma uthayipha kubha yekheli noma ebhokisini lokusesha, iBrave ithumela okuthayiphayo kusesho lwenhlangano yakho, i-AI, nakumathuluzi omenzeli ukuthola iziphakamiso.</translation>
