<translation id="4920206821838432969">Lapho uvakashela isayithi, iBrave ithumela ingxenye eyi-obfuscation ye-URL kokuthi <ph name="BEGIN_LINK"/>Ukubhrawuza ngokuphephile kweBrave<ph name="END_LINK"/> isebenzisa iseva yangasese efihla ikheli lakho lasesizindeni se-inthanethi. Uma isayithi ingakusekeli okuthile okusolisayo, kuzothunyelwa wonke ama-URL kanye nekhontenti encane yekhasi.</translation>
