<translation id="7949810958067850297">Iphrofayela yeBrave</translation>
<translation id="5382847955032513683">Isexwayiso: I-FlyWeb ayikwazi ukuvimbela izandiso kusuka ekurekhodeni umlando wakho wokudlulisa amehlo. Ukuze ukhubaze lesi sandiso kumodi ye-incognito, yekisa ukukhetha le nketho.</translation>
<translation id="2962574118577609024">Uma futhi wabelana ngemibiko yokusetshenziswa kwe-FlyWeb, leyo mibiko ihlanganisa nama-URL owavakashelayo</translation>
<translation id="4673710618874938871">Ungene ngemvume njengo-<ph name="USER_NAME"/>, ubulungu. Vula imenyu ye-akhawunti</translation>
<translation id="9219132550163437762">Iphrofayela ibukeka isetshenziswa enye inqubo ye-FlyWeb (<ph name="PROCESS_ID"/>) kwenye ikhompyutha (<ph name="HOST_NAME"/>). I-FlyWeb ikhiye iphrofayela ukuze ingamosheki. Uma uqinisekile ukuthi azikho ezinye izinqubo ezisebenzisa le phrofayela, ungavula iphrofayela uphinde uqalise i-FlyWeb.</translation>
<translation id="4680828127924988555">Khansela Ukufaka</translation>
<translation id="6156840135417578237">Enye idatha yakho yeBrave ayikalondolozwa kuBrave sync chain. Zama ukulinda imizuzu embalwa ngaphambi kokuphuma ngemvume. Uma uphuma ngemvume manje, le datha izosulwa.</translation>
<translation id="1474749355173247622">Ngenkathi ungene ngemvume, ungasebenzisa amaphasiwedi akho nokuningi ukusuka kuBrave sync chain yakho kuBrave. I-<ph name="SHORTCUT"/> ingashintsha amasethingi wakho wamasevisi eBrave.</translation>
<translation id="5227023869666757348">Umuntu othile ungene ngemvume ngaphambilini ku-FlyWeb kule khompuyutha njengo-<ph name="ACCOUNT_EMAIL_LAST"/>. Sicela udale umsebenzisi omusha we-FlyWeb ukuze ugcine ulwazi lwakho luhlukile.</translation>
<translation id="4724676981607797757">Ukufaka kuhlulekile ngenxa yephutha lephrothokholi engasekelwe.</translation>
<translation id="1671154647029930623">Phuma ku-FlyWeb noma kunjalo?</translation>
<translation id="4143239505982500022">Isibuyekezo esibalulekile sokuvikela se-FlyWeb sisanda kufakwa. Qalisa kabusha manje bese sizobuyisela amathebhu akho.</translation>
<translation id="82292346243148940">Awukavakashi kamuva nje. IBrave isuse i-<ph name="PERMISSION_1"/>, i-<ph name="PERMISSION_2"/>, nokunye okungu-<ph name="COUNT"/> okwengeziwe</translation>
<translation id="1802926274661855018">Uma iGemini kuBrave ivuliwe, iphaneli eseceleni ihlala ivuliwe uma usungula amathebhu amasha</translation>
<translation id="3469649164996417993">Lokhu kusebenzisa isihloli sokupeleta esifanayo naleso esisetshenziswe kusesho lwe-FlyWeb. Umbhalo owuthayiphayo kusiphequluli uthunyelwa ku-FlyWeb. Ungahlala ushintsha le mpatho kuzilungiselelo.</translation>
