<translation id="2441009746272048284">IChromeOS ayikwazanga ukulondoloza idatha yeBrave kuBrave sync chain yakho ngoba imininingwane yakho yokungena ngemvume ku-akhawunti iphelelwe yisikhathi</translation>
<translation id="8449603408481238073">Ungena ngemvume nge-akhawunti ephethwe futhi unikeza umlawuli wayo ukulawula okungaphezulu kwephrofayela yakho ye-FlyWeb. Idatha yakho ye-FlyWeb, efana nezinhlelo zakho zokusebenza, amabhukhimakhi, umlando, amaphasiwedi, nezinye izilungiselelo zizoboshezelwa unaphakade ku-<ph name="USER_NAME"/>. Uzokwazi ukususa le datha nge-Ideshibhodi yama-Akhawunti we-FlyWeb, kodwa ngeke uze ukwazi ukuhlobanisa le datha nenye i-akhawunti. <ph name="LEARN_MORE"/></translation>
