<translation id="1842654828911709974">{NUM_TABS,plural, =1{IBrave Incoma Ukumisa Ithebhu Enciphisa Ijubane Lebhrawuza Yakho}one{IBrave Incoma Ukumisa Amathebhu Anciphisa Ijubane Lebhrawuza Yakho}other{IBrave Incoma Ukumisa Amathebhu Anciphisa Ijubane Lebhrawuza Yakho}}</translation>
<translation id="5385202369020319636">I-FlyWeb kungenzeka ingasebenzi ngokufanelekile ngoba ayisasekelwa kule sistimu yokusatshalaliswa kwe-Linux</translation>
<translation id="362367838300880777">I-FlyWeb ivimbele lokhu kudawuniloda ngoba ifayela lingalimaza ama-akhawunti wakho omuntu siqu nawenethiwekhi yokuxhumana nomphakathi</translation>
<translation id="2183749398075655200">Sicela ulinde ngenkathi i-FlyWeb ifaka izibuyekezo zesistimu zakamuva.</translation>
<translation id="8996657165865563765">I-FlyWeb izama ukuhlela amaphasiwedi. Thayipha iphasiwedi yakho ye-Windows ukuze uvumele lokhu.</translation>
<translation id="832204641669191126">Sebenza ngaphandle kokuphazamiseka ngama-app akho ayintandokazi njengeGoogle Drive neYouTube usendleleni ngeBrave.</translation>
<translation id="5524890928877629608">ikhona elingaphezulu ngakwesokunxele lendawo yokusesha: ngakwesokunxele okungu-<ph name="LEFT"/>%, phezulu okungu<ph name="TOP"/>%</translation>
