<translation id="6197315294677032380">Ukuvikeleka, iBrave ivala ukulungiselela kweJavaScript uma uvakashela isayithi okokuqala ngqa.

Uma leli khasi lingasebenzi njengoba kulindelekile, zama ukuvumela ukulungiselela.</translation>
