<translation id="1307223624786767430">U-<ph name="EXISTING_USER"/> usevele ungene ngemvume. Ukuze ugcine ukubhrawuza kwakho kuhlukile, ngena ngemvume kuBrave kuphrofayela yakho njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL_ADDRESS"/> Uzophinde uthole ulwazi lwakho olulondoloziwe nokuningi ku-<ph name="DEVICE"/>.</translation>
